2
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,540
He blocked it!

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,110
Tsubasa-kun defends the goal with his face.

4
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:11,900
The ball is still in play!

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,200
We'll press them!

6
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:19,290
Is this the true power of Tsubasa and the champion Nankatsu?

7
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:22,660
Nankatsu, lacking Wakabayashi and Misaki...

8
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:27,820
Nankatsu, which many people have challenged, remained undefeated.

9
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,460
And Tsubasa too...

10
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,840
No matter how much fighting spirit I show...

11
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:34,680
No matter how much effort I put in...

12
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,010
No matter how strong my friends are...

13
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,950
The prodigy of football, Tsubasa Ozora,

14
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:43,850
can I not surpass you after all?!

15
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:49,190
Don't get up anymore, Tsubasa-kun.

16
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,850
Alright, let's go!

17
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,990
Now Nankatsu has stolen the ball!

18
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:57,370
The second half of extra time in the grand final of the National Middle School Football Tournament!

19
00:00:57,370 --> 00:01:00,160
Only five minutes left!

20
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,700
The match is heading towards its conclusion!

21
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:07,920
The only man I ever wanted to be... Tsubasa Ozora.

22
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:11,090
Please, someone tell me!

23
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:14,220
How can I catch up to Tsubasa?

24
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:18,970
How can I become Tsubasa Ozora?!

26
00:01:21,220 --> 00:01:31,140
Love! Love! Love!

27
00:01:38,030 --> 00:01:40,860
I keep lying to myself.

28
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:47,120
I say I can live alone, even if loneliness burns me.

29
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:53,000
Even though you knew how fragile my pride was.

30
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:59,590
Tonight, even my heart is shattered.

31
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:03,590
I hate being helpless.

32
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:08,100
The longing for your voice.

33
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:13,690
"I have to go back right away!"

34
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:15,230
I'm stupid, aren't I?

35
00:02:15,230 --> 00:02:16,440
Love!

36
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:19,940
Believing in my wounded love...

37
00:02:19,940 --> 00:02:29,830
I will turn these fallen tears into strength.

38
00:02:29,830 --> 00:02:30,660
Love!

39
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:34,460
Even though it's a wounded love,

40
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:38,460
it illuminates my world.

41
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:44,720
Even for a moment,

42
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:47,550
I won't let this love go!

43
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:54,770
EPISODE 52:
ENDLESS DREAM

44
00:02:50,250 --> 00:02:54,380
Will Nankatsu be able to protect the goal scored by Tsubasa-kun's Miracle Drive Shot

45
00:02:50,250 --> 00:02:54,380
Miracle Drive Shot

46
00:02:54,380 --> 00:02:56,510
in the first half of extra time?

47
00:02:56,510 --> 00:02:59,670
Tsubasa, just a little more! Hang in there a bit more!

48
00:02:59,670 --> 00:03:00,530
Okay.

49
00:03:00,530 --> 00:03:05,240
Nankatsu has truly fought and won tough battles in this tournament.

50
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:10,080
Alright, let's score again and settle it at once!

51
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:13,080
Against their greatest rival, Toho,

52
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:16,090
they are showing their strength in this final match!

53
00:03:16,090 --> 00:03:17,780
Damn it!

54
00:03:17,780 --> 00:03:19,090
We can't get the ball!

55
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:20,780
Will I lose...

56
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:22,810
Will I lose this match?!

57
00:03:22,810 --> 00:03:25,510
Will I lose to Tsubasa again?!

58
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:26,820
What's wrong, Hyuga?

59
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:27,650
Get your ass up!

60
00:03:27,650 --> 00:03:28,520
Matsuyama...

61
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:31,310
You're not the type of man to let it end like this!

62
00:03:31,310 --> 00:03:33,940
If I can't be Tsubasa Ozora...

63
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:38,010
Then I must be Kojiro Hyuga and play until the very end,

64
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:42,070
the football style that brought me here...!

65
00:03:43,450 --> 00:03:46,120
Hyuga-kun runs wildly toward the ball.

66
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,240
But in vain!

67
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,290
Running with all your strength won't win you the ball...

68
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:53,920
So after all, Hyuga couldn't surpass Tsubasa...

69
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,010
Hyuga-san...

70
00:04:00,010 --> 00:04:01,020
Captain...

71
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:02,220
Damn it!

72
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:06,300
Because Hyuga-kun inspired them, they're all running towards the ball!

73
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,810
Sorimachi-kun steals the ball!

74
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:09,690
Everyone...

75
00:04:09,690 --> 00:04:11,100
Captain!

76
00:04:12,350 --> 00:04:13,810
Alright!

77
00:04:14,650 --> 00:04:16,770
I have to play my own football.

78
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:20,230
I have to fight Tsubasa with my own football!

79
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:24,780
Go Hyuga! Go Toho!

80
00:04:20,230 --> 00:04:21,920
Only 3 minutes left in the match.

81
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,780
Will this be Toho's final attack in the finals?!

82
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:29,580
We'll play our football, Toho's football!

83
00:04:29,580 --> 00:04:30,540
Yes!

84
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:33,250
Here it comes... This will be our final show of strength.

85
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:36,750
Nankatsu chooses a clever defensive formation.

86
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:41,630
Hyuga-kun uses his straight-line dribbling technique.

87
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:43,630
We won't let you score anymore!

88
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:44,260
Stop him!

89
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:44,840
Okay!

90
00:04:46,050 --> 00:04:48,220
A beautifully executed one-two pass!

91
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:48,950
Damn it!

92
00:04:48,950 --> 00:04:49,970
As if we'd let you!

93
00:04:51,100 --> 00:04:52,230
Hyuga-san!

94
00:04:52,230 --> 00:04:52,870
Takeshi!

95
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:54,610
Now it's Toho's Teacher-Student Duo!

96
00:04:54,610 --> 00:04:56,690
A return one-two pass from Sawada-kun!

97
00:04:57,440 --> 00:05:00,070
Hyuga-kun quickly finds himself in front of Nankatsu's goal!

98
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:01,730
Three minutes left!

99
00:05:01,730 --> 00:05:04,570
Will this be his last chance to shoot?

100
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:10,760
We won't let you score!

101
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:13,160
We'll protect this goal that Tsubasa scored!

102
00:05:14,660 --> 00:05:17,470
They formed a block, a wall...

103
00:05:17,470 --> 00:05:19,670
You did a great job, Nankatsu.

104
00:05:19,670 --> 00:05:22,550
This is my loss, Tsubasa.

105
00:05:22,550 --> 00:05:25,170
I really can't win with my own football style.

106
00:05:25,170 --> 00:05:26,230
However...

107
00:05:26,230 --> 00:05:29,100
Even if I lose, I'll play until the end.

108
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:30,830
My football is about power!

109
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:31,810
I'll blow you away!

110
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:35,110
I'll blow away Nankatsu's wall and Tsubasa!

111
00:05:35,110 --> 00:05:38,220
I'll entrust everything that everyone at Toho and I have done so far

112
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:41,320
to my right leg!

113
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:46,030
Go... My Tiger Shot!

114
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:46,030
Tiger Shot

115
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:47,480
Don't do it, Hyuga-san!

116
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,280
Shooting from here won't score!

117
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:55,960
T-That's it!

118
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,080
What?!

119
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,430
Takeshi, your leg!

120
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:01,340
Lift your leg like this!

121
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:02,000
Huh?!

122
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,760
Ah, this...

123
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:06,090
Hyuga-san!

124
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:11,010
He used Sawada-kun's leg to jump over them!

125
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:12,260
What?!

126
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,430
Hyuga-kun!

127
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:17,480
Hyuga!

128
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:17,980
Captain!

129
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:18,480
Kojiro!

130
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,060
Big brother!

131
00:06:20,460 --> 00:06:22,570
This is Tsubasa's football...

132
00:06:22,570 --> 00:06:26,070
No, this is real football!

133
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:34,970
Go, Overhead Tiger Shot!

134
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:34,970
Overhead Tiger Shot

135
00:06:34,970 --> 00:06:37,330
Hyuga-kun launched his shot!

136
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:38,000
Hyuga!

137
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:38,390
Ah...!

138
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:41,080
No one can stop this!

139
00:06:43,420 --> 00:06:46,630
But it hits the goalkeeper right in the abdomen!

140
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:50,130
Ah, the ball sends the goalkeeper flying!

141
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:51,640
Tsubasa!

142
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:55,420
Tsubasa-kun caught Morisaki-kun!

143
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:58,140
Securing Nankatsu's 3rd championship!

144
00:06:58,140 --> 00:06:58,890
Ah!

145
00:06:58,890 --> 00:06:59,890
Tsubasa-kun!

146
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,190
It's tied!

147
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:11,410
Toho Academy equalizes!

148
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:17,890
With one minute left in the match, Toho finally managed to tie the score!

149
00:07:17,890 --> 00:07:18,750
That's it!

150
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:22,100
A blow that revived them!

151
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:23,500
Captain!

152
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:25,150
Kojiro...

153
00:07:25,150 --> 00:07:28,510
To think that with a snap decision, you'd pull this off...

154
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:30,460
You did very well, Hyuga.

155
00:07:30,460 --> 00:07:34,720
Tsubasa is great, but you're no less!

156
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,850
Nice shot, Hyuga.

157
00:07:36,850 --> 00:07:39,860
I feel like I'm starting to understand why Tsubasa kept fighting

158
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:42,860
until his body was a little more battered.

159
00:07:42,860 --> 00:07:45,650
Because football is fun!

160
00:07:45,730 --> 00:07:47,940
Every moment you live while playing,

161
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:51,610
you're playing, making your own decisions and ideas.

162
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,740
You won't be bound by anyone.

163
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:56,950
Yes, football means freedom.

164
00:07:57,480 --> 00:08:01,650
While I was targeting Tsubasa with my small heart,

165
00:08:01,650 --> 00:08:06,910
Tsubasa played football with a big heart that I didn't possess.

166
00:08:06,910 --> 00:08:09,210
As expected of you, Hyuga-kun.

167
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:13,250
Just like Tsubasa used a modified Drive Shot to score,

168
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:13,250
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

169
00:08:13,250 --> 00:08:16,480
Tiger Shot

170
00:08:13,250 --> 00:08:16,480
Hyuga modified his own Tiger Shot.

171
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:21,230
Hyuga has caught up to Tsubasa once more.

172
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:22,620
4-4.

173
00:08:22,620 --> 00:08:24,940
The match goes back to square one once again!

174
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:27,480
Hooray! Hooray! Nankatsu!

175
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,480
One minute left on the clock.

176
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:30,080
There are no further extra times in the final game.

177
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:33,320
Will both teams be declared winners in this way?

178
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:37,240
Or will one of them be able to reach the winning goal?

179
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,040
The match continues!

180
00:08:40,040 --> 00:08:42,410
Nankatsu began their final attack.

181
00:08:43,950 --> 00:08:45,960
Sorimachi-kun steals the ball immediately!

182
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,830
Captain!

183
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,210
The ball is sent to Hyuga-kun.

184
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:51,770
One more minute.

185
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:54,550
The shot I'll take within this minute will determine the outcome!

186
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,600
We'll stop him!

187
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,720
We must stop him ourselves!

188
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,600
Okay!

189
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,230
Block the passing lanes too!

190
00:09:01,430 --> 00:09:02,300
Good!

191
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:04,190
They can do their job even without Tsubasa.

192
00:09:04,190 --> 00:09:05,660
He can't send a pass.

193
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:08,020
Hyuga-kun holds the ball.

194
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:09,270
Damn it!

195
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:11,940
Little time left on the clock!

196
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:14,720
Not much time left in extra time.

197
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:18,220
There's no time! Abandon defense and everyone attack!

198
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,120
Okay!

199
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:24,380
He got past three!

200
00:09:24,380 --> 00:09:25,290
Damn it!

201
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:30,260
Nankatsu keeps Hyuga-kun in check!

202
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:32,090
Will time run out like this?

203
00:09:32,090 --> 00:09:34,140
Everyone...

204
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,940
Everyone is doing their best!

205
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:38,160
I can... I can do it too!

206
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,470
Tsubasa...

207
00:09:41,970 --> 00:09:44,480
Of course a chance will emerge!

208
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,600
Damn it!

209
00:09:46,270 --> 00:09:46,890
There it is!

210
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:48,490
He broke through!

211
00:09:48,490 --> 00:09:50,310
Hyuga-kun is coming forward!

212
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:51,890
I see it.

213
00:09:51,890 --> 00:09:55,110
The goal that will bring me—us—victory!

214
00:09:55,820 --> 00:09:56,870
Stop him!

215
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:59,160
Eat this and finish last!

216
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:05,580
This is my... Final Tiger Shot!

217
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:05,580
Final Tiger Shot

218
00:10:05,940 --> 00:10:10,330
Tsubasa-kun, who was in front of the goal, appeared in Hyuga-kun's path!

219
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:12,330
He jumps to block it!

220
00:10:12,330 --> 00:10:14,090
T-Tsubasa!

221
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:19,800
Ah, the ball hit the post!

222
00:10:20,890 --> 00:10:22,300
We're lucky!

223
00:10:22,300 --> 00:10:26,640
The ball hit Tsubasa's hair and changed its trajectory!

224
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:32,310
However, there is a player who hasn't given up yet.

225
00:10:32,310 --> 00:10:37,650
Ozora Tsubasa-kun has reached half of the ball possession rate!

226
00:10:40,110 --> 00:10:41,610
Tsubasa!

227
00:10:41,610 --> 00:10:42,870
You're so...

228
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,120
Tsubasa-kun!

229
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:48,370
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

230
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:48,370
Tsubasa-kun gathers all his strength for one final Drive Shot!

231
00:10:48,370 --> 00:10:49,250
Tsubasa!

232
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:52,130
The Prodigal Son of Football, Tsubasa Ozora!

233
00:10:52,130 --> 00:10:55,030
Will you be greedy for victory after all?

234
00:10:59,180 --> 00:10:59,880
Hyuga-kun!

235
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,970
Tsubasa!

236
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:19,070
Hyuga-kun keeps countering the Drive Shot with the Tiger Shot!

237
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:19,070
Tiger Shot
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

238
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:20,860
Big brother!

239
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:26,160
Toho or Nankatsu? Whose goal will the ball ultimately be?

240
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,660
It's rising straight up!

241
00:11:36,660 --> 00:11:39,170
The ball rises above them!

242
00:11:39,170 --> 00:11:41,480
This is what I expected from you, Tsubasa.

243
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:44,180
To think you'd aim for victory until the very end,

244
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:48,020
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

245
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:48,020
and even with your injured body, try to fire a Drive Shot...

246
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:51,020
Truly just as expected from you, Tsubasa Ozora.

247
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:53,080
Just as I expected from you, Hyuga-kun...

248
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:56,960
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

249
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:56,960
You didn't let me score with my final Drive Shot.

250
00:11:56,960 --> 00:12:00,500
Tiger Shot

251
00:11:56,960 --> 00:12:00,500
Considering you'd counter with your Tiger Shot...

252
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:03,910
You are truly the Wild Tiger, Kojiro Hyuga.

253
00:12:06,730 --> 00:12:08,180
The match is over!

254
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:08,830
Score 4-4!

255
00:12:09,530 --> 00:12:13,530
Neither team could change the score and the game ended in a tie!

256
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:16,670
With this, both teams will be declared winners!

257
00:12:17,110 --> 00:12:19,040
Is it over...?

258
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:20,780
It's over...

259
00:12:24,630 --> 00:12:25,820
Is this the end?

260
00:12:26,380 --> 00:12:27,600
A tie...

261
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:30,100
A draw...

262
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:36,530
Despite ending in a tie, Nankatsu achieved the first consecutive 3 championships in tournament history!

263
00:12:36,530 --> 00:12:38,010
This is our first victory!

264
00:12:38,010 --> 00:12:43,110
Toho's 1st championship! We are the first to hold the title in University, High School, and Middle School!

265
00:12:43,110 --> 00:12:44,800
Both were declared champions.

266
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:47,780
This result might be the best.

267
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:49,430
Tsubasa, we have 3 championships!

268
00:12:49,430 --> 00:12:51,020
We did it!

269
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:53,040
Our dream came true!

270
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,780
Hyuga-san, this is our 1st championship!

271
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,710
We won, captain!

272
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:01,440
It's over...

273
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:10,010
Tsubasa...

274
00:13:10,010 --> 00:13:11,390
Hyuga-kun...

275
00:13:14,010 --> 00:13:18,520
In our final encounter, I couldn't defeat you.

276
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,190
It's just a tie.

277
00:13:20,190 --> 00:13:25,170
No. In the second half of the match, if your Tiger Shot

278
00:13:25,170 --> 00:13:27,700
hadn't hit me and had directly become a goal,

279
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:30,990
Toho would have won and been the sole champion.

280
00:13:30,990 --> 00:13:32,200
Tsubasa...

281
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:37,570
Thanks to that, I've been able to keep fighting without regrets until now.

282
00:13:37,570 --> 00:13:40,300
Thank you, Hyuga-kun.

283
00:13:40,300 --> 00:13:42,360
You're right.

284
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:48,220
With the victory my team achieved, I chose to duel with you.

285
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:51,490
I wanted to do it when you were in your best condition.

286
00:13:51,490 --> 00:13:53,680
Sorry, Hyuga-kun.

287
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:58,610
Hurry up and go to Brazil!

288
00:13:58,610 --> 00:13:59,480
What—

289
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:02,470
If you keep lingering before my eyes,

290
00:14:02,470 --> 00:14:05,180
I'll eventually just aim for you.

291
00:14:05,180 --> 00:14:06,360
Hyuga-kun!

292
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:10,400
But today, everything became clear to me.

293
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:14,370
I understood a little more about how fun football can be.

294
00:14:14,370 --> 00:14:18,470
From now on, I'll stop trying to catch up to you.

295
00:14:18,470 --> 00:14:21,380
I won't try to defeat you anymore.

296
00:14:21,380 --> 00:14:27,010
From now on, I'll aim even higher, like you.

297
00:14:27,010 --> 00:14:30,720
I don't know yet what that higher target could be.

298
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:33,590
Hyuga-kun, I...

299
00:14:33,590 --> 00:14:37,230
When I graduate from middle school, I will go to Brazil!

300
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:38,770
Tsubasa...

301
00:14:39,730 --> 00:14:43,860
With this, our battle is over for now.

302
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:45,400
Yes.

303
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,990
Tsubasa...

304
00:14:46,990 --> 00:14:48,610
Hyuga-san...

305
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,790
As a sign of mutual respect,

306
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:09,710
Hyuga-kun and Tsubasa-kun exchange their uniforms.

307
00:15:09,710 --> 00:15:14,560
Both players smile after a match they don't regret.

308
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,660
Eternal rivals...

309
00:15:20,660 --> 00:15:22,900
That is Tsubasa Ozora and Kojiro Hyuga.

310
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:29,150
They are also eternal football friends.

311
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:35,120
The championship flag will now be presented!

312
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:43,440
The crimson championship flag was awarded to Ozora Tsubasa-kun from Nankatsu

313
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:47,420
and Hyuga Kojiro-kun from Toho Academy.

314
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:49,650
By the mutual decision of both teams,

315
00:15:49,650 --> 00:15:52,250
this championship flag will first be taken to Toho Academy.

316
00:15:52,250 --> 00:15:55,510
It will be given to Nankatsu 6 months later.

317
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:57,740
Then I'll take it first.

318
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,700
Go ahead.

319
00:16:00,130 --> 00:16:04,360
Hyuga-kun raised the championship flag in the air!

320
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,290
Hyuga-san!

321
00:16:05,290 --> 00:16:06,770
Captain!

322
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:11,530
This is the championship flag we all worked together to get.

323
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,280
Hyuga...

324
00:16:13,870 --> 00:16:16,860
I dreamed of seeing Kojiro this happy.

325
00:16:16,860 --> 00:16:20,700
Kojiro, for the first time in Japan, became the best!

326
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:21,450
Big brother!

327
00:16:21,450 --> 00:16:21,930
You did it!

328
00:16:21,930 --> 00:16:22,360
Kojiro!

329
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,710
Congratulations!

330
00:16:24,380 --> 00:16:27,580
After the presentation of the championship flag,

331
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:30,760
the 24 best players of the tournament were announced.

332
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:34,160
Tsubasa and Kojiro are at the top of the list;

333
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:38,300
these players represent this generation of players.

334
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:46,810
16th National Middle School Tournament

335
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:42,060
Ken Wakashimazu    (Toho Academy)

336
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:42,060
Yuzo Morisaki             (Nankatsu Middle School)

337
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:42,060
Masanori Kato            (Furano Middle School)

338
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:39,810
Wakashimazu-san!

339
00:16:39,810 --> 00:16:41,810
Morisaki, you were selected!

340
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:46,810
Ryo Ishizaki                      (Nankatsu Middle School)

341
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:46,810
Shingo Takasugi                  (Nankatsu Middle School)

342
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:46,810
Hiroshi Jito                        (Hirado Middle School)

343
00:16:41,890 --> 00:16:46,810
Makoto Soda                     (Azumaichi Middle School)

344
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:45,400
What!? I was selected too?

345
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,810
Oh, I made it!

346
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:50,320
MF

347
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:50,320
Tsubasa Ozora       (Nankatsu Middle School)

348
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:50,320
Mamoru Izawa          (Nankatsu Middle School)

349
00:16:46,810 --> 00:16:50,320
Hikaru Matsuyama   (Furano Middle School)

350
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:52,450
Matsuyama-kun, you were selected!

351
00:16:52,450 --> 00:16:53,490
Yes.

352
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,940
What—

353
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:55,990
I did it!

354
00:16:57,410 --> 00:16:58,430
Captain!

355
00:16:58,430 --> 00:16:59,290
Yes.

356
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:02,870
16th National Middle School Tournament

357
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,120
Kojiro Hyuga             (Toho Academy)

358
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,120
Kazuki Sorimachi    (Toho Academy)

359
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,120
Hajime Taki                (Nankatsu Middle School)

360
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,120
Kisugi Teppei             (Nankatsu Middle School)

361
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,120
Kazumasa Oda          (Furano Middle School)

362
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,870
Mitsuru Sano                (Hirado Middle School)

363
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,870
Masao Tachibana       (Hanawa Middle School)

364
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,870
Kazuo Tachibana        (Hanawa Middle School)

365
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,870
Kazuto Takei                 (Minamiuwa Middle School)

366
00:17:00,870 --> 00:17:02,870
Noboru Sawaki             (Meiwahigashi Middle School)

367
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:04,460
Oh, we were both selected, you know!

368
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:05,370
Yes!

369
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:07,040
We were selected!

370
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:10,620
After this, they will invite us to a training camp.

371
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:14,590
Japan's Youth tournament representatives will be selected from among them,

372
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:17,540
and they will go on a European tour.

373
00:17:17,540 --> 00:17:19,030
Katagiri-san.

374
00:17:19,030 --> 00:17:19,680
Yes?

375
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:22,760
Will you let me join the representatives,

376
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,930
as a "coach"?

377
00:17:23,930 --> 00:17:26,400
Of course, I'd be happy to have you.

378
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,000
Misugi...

379
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,610
TOHO ACADEMY - TOKYO

380
00:17:29,770 --> 00:17:31,610
Let's take a photo!

381
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:32,250
Alright, here goes!

382
00:17:32,250 --> 00:17:33,610
Yay!

383
00:17:33,610 --> 00:17:35,080
Hey, don't move!

384
00:17:36,610 --> 00:17:38,740
CLUB RESIGNATION NOTICE

385
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:40,740
Good job, everyone.

386
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:41,780
Coach!

387
00:17:41,780 --> 00:17:44,060
Ah, don't mind me!

388
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:45,500
Well done!

389
00:17:45,500 --> 00:17:47,790
The first championship for Toho Academy!

390
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,280
YES!

391
00:17:50,290 --> 00:17:51,000
We did it!

392
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,860
We finally did it!

393
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,000
Our 1st championship!

394
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,300
Coach.

395
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,840
Please accept this.

396
00:17:58,260 --> 00:17:59,140
Captain!

397
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:00,840
Hyuga-san!

398
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:02,190
A club resignation notice?

399
00:18:02,190 --> 00:18:02,760
Correct.

400
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:07,670
Even though I'm the captain, I left the team without any notice and went to Okinawa.

401
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:09,270
I take responsibility.

402
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:10,260
No way...

403
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:11,400
Captain...

404
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:18,530
You don't need to quit.

405
00:18:18,530 --> 00:18:20,100
I will be the one resigning.

406
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,120
Coach?!

407
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:24,760
My resignation letter was accepted by the principal.

408
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:28,040
When I decided to deviate from my principles and use you,

409
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:30,630
I decided to stop being Toho's coach.

410
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:34,770
However, thanks to that, we became champions, Hyuga.

411
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:37,840
But I won't stop being involved in football.

412
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:42,290
Maybe next time I'll appear as your opponent at a different school.

413
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:44,010
B-But coach...

414
00:18:44,010 --> 00:18:48,210
If you resign now, what will Wakashimazu, Sawada,

415
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:52,480
and the other comrades who followed you do?

416
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:57,140
If you're that determined, when you enter high school,

417
00:18:57,140 --> 00:19:01,390
take responsibility as captain in every action.

418
00:19:01,390 --> 00:19:04,040
That is your duty.

419
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:06,120
Coach...

420
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:13,250
The meeting is adjourned.

421
00:19:14,260 --> 00:19:16,810
Toho Academy Football Team! All of you, line up!

422
00:19:16,810 --> 00:19:17,960
Okay!

423
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:22,500
Salute Coach Kitazume!

424
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,640
Thank you very much!

425
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,940
Everyone...

426
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:34,360
I have been blessed with excellent students!

427
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,860
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL - SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

428
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:38,360
Does it still hurt?

429
00:19:38,770 --> 00:19:41,250
I feel much better.

430
00:19:41,250 --> 00:19:43,840
Thank you for everything, manager.

431
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:48,120
Tsubasa-kun, get well soon.

432
00:19:49,090 --> 00:19:50,020
Tsubasa!

433
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:51,450
Let us thank you too.

434
00:19:51,450 --> 00:19:52,370
What?

435
00:19:52,370 --> 00:19:54,440
Our dream came true.

436
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:57,300
We will graduate from middle school in 3 years without a single defeat.

437
00:19:57,300 --> 00:20:00,180
If you had gone to Brazil, it couldn't have come true.

438
00:20:00,180 --> 00:20:01,700
That's not true, everyone.

439
00:20:02,130 --> 00:20:05,120
I couldn't make your dreams come true.

440
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,890
We all made it come true together!

441
00:20:06,890 --> 00:20:08,080
Tsubasa...

442
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,680
I see... That's it.

443
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,380
We did it!

444
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:11,100
Yes!

445
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:12,560
Oh yes, we did it!

446
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:14,810
We did it! Our 3 championships!

447
00:20:14,810 --> 00:20:16,570
YES!

448
00:20:17,010 --> 00:20:19,570
I saw everything clearly from the start.

449
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:23,360
These guys are the golden generation that will connect us to the world.

450
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:25,630
Golden Age.

451
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:25,630
Golden Age

452
00:20:25,630 --> 00:20:28,400
From now on, you'll play on the world stage.

453
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,910
Help each other,

454
00:20:29,910 --> 00:20:34,380
and next time, spread your wings on the great stage of the world.

455
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:37,870
Nankatsu and Toho became joint champions.

456
00:20:35,050 --> 00:20:41,100
Hey, look at that ace passing by.

457
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:43,050
Thus the curtain closes on the greatest final match in history.

458
00:20:41,100 --> 00:20:47,100
He's the best and the whole city is proud of him.

459
00:20:43,970 --> 00:20:46,260
— A FEW DAYS LATER —

460
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:49,010
In Shizuoka prefecture, there's an in-city training camp for candidates for Japan's Youth representatives.

461
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:51,970
The 24 members of Japan's Youth representatives led by Kojiro Hyuga,

462
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:53,150
Butterfly samba zig-zag samba

463
00:20:51,970 --> 00:20:54,480
started their training camp.

464
00:20:53,150 --> 00:20:57,780
Even little old ladies are talking about him.

465
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:59,360
Due to injuries sustained during the Nationals, Tsubasa Ozora is not there.

466
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:04,110
So, even if we have him, who are we?

467
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:04,650
In his place, Shun Nitta from Otomo Middle School is participating as an exception.

468
00:21:05,390 --> 00:21:07,800
There are really amazing players here, aren't there?

469
00:21:05,410 --> 00:21:11,500
Spinning around the ball.

470
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:08,890
You're right.

471
00:21:09,990 --> 00:21:12,140
Are the necessary pieces still insufficient?

472
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:16,880
Run, Run, Run! Kick and run!

473
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:14,320
It's true we've gathered great players.

474
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:16,880
However, if he were here...

475
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,260
You're right.

476
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:22,420
Someday, I'll make a lightning shot!

477
00:21:18,260 --> 00:21:20,640
Then this could be an incredibly strong team.

478
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:22,420
That's how I feel.

479
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:24,930
Wow, this is so nice!

480
00:21:23,520 --> 00:21:29,650
When I do that, I'll be a superhero!

481
00:21:25,330 --> 00:21:26,350
Everyone.

482
00:21:27,470 --> 00:21:30,340
Why isn't anyone wearing this?

483
00:21:29,650 --> 00:21:35,690
Run, Run, Run! Kick and run!

484
00:21:31,220 --> 00:21:33,340
Isn't it obvious?

485
00:21:33,340 --> 00:21:35,980
We must save it for him.

486
00:21:35,690 --> 00:21:42,140
Burning youth racing across the field!

487
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:37,650
Right.

488
00:21:37,650 --> 00:21:40,860
But there's still one uniform missing, isn't there?

489
00:21:40,860 --> 00:21:44,410
Using my authority as coach, I gave one to Katagiri.

490
00:21:44,410 --> 00:21:45,360
What?

491
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:46,860
This means...

492
00:21:46,950 --> 00:21:49,370
— FRANCE - PARIS —

493
00:21:52,010 --> 00:21:53,660
Hey, that's dangerous!

494
00:21:53,660 --> 00:21:56,120
You'll hurt yourself if you're not careful!

495
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,390
Everything's fine!

496
00:21:57,390 --> 00:21:59,250
The ball is my friend!

497
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:02,050
Isn't that right, Tsubasa-kun?

498
00:22:02,050 --> 00:22:04,900
Tsubasa Ozora and Taro Misaki...

499
00:22:04,900 --> 00:22:09,890
Without the Golden Duo, we cannot have Japan's new representatives.

500
00:22:09,970 --> 00:22:12,390
— GERMANY - HAMBURG —

501
00:22:20,190 --> 00:22:22,820
It's in! Fire Shot!

502
00:22:20,190 --> 00:22:22,820
Fire Shot

503
00:22:24,620 --> 00:22:28,840
So you've elevated your shot to a completely new level, Schneider!

504
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:34,230
Tsubasa, the world is vast!

505
00:22:34,230 --> 00:22:35,830
There are great players everywhere!

506
00:22:36,780 --> 00:22:41,340
You must leave Japan soon and spread your wings, Tsubasa!

507
00:22:43,450 --> 00:22:47,260
I'm so happy I moved to Nankatsu.

508
00:22:47,770 --> 00:22:52,590
3 years ago, I didn't realize my dream of leaving with Roberto from here,

509
00:22:52,590 --> 00:22:57,020
but because of that, I saw a new dream with everyone.

510
00:22:57,100 --> 00:22:59,770
— BRAZIL - SAO PAULO —

511
00:22:57,600 --> 00:23:01,480
But this time I will go to Brazil.

512
00:23:01,480 --> 00:23:03,770
The kingdom of football, Brazil...

513
00:23:03,770 --> 00:23:09,200
The country of the person who taught me the love of football, Brazil...

514
00:23:12,360 --> 00:23:15,320
I'll go to Brazil and become a professional there.

515
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:21,290
Even if I've achieved one dream, the story won't end there.

516
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:25,550
One day, I'll become the number 1 professional football player.

517
00:23:25,550 --> 00:23:29,050
Then I'll be on the Japanese National Team and become number 1 in the world...

518
00:23:29,050 --> 00:23:32,360
I'll make all my dreams come true!

519
00:23:34,140 --> 00:23:36,100
Go!

522
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:50,440
CAPTAIN TSUBASA

523
00:23:47,440 --> 00:23:50,440
THE END